  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CORE FUNDING TO MISEAN CARA, WHICH PROVIDES GRANTS TO MISSIONARY ORGANISATIONS FOR THEIR DEVELOPMENT WORK IN AFRICA, ASIA AND SOUTH AMERICA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PARTNER: Edmund Rice Development PROJECT: Edmund Rice Development in the Philippines aims for long-term sustainability, breaking the cycle of homelessness and fostering stability and self-sufficiency. Marginalized communities will be accompanied to ensure families secure safe, stable housing through the government&apos;s affordable programs, addressing basic needs like healthcare, education, childcare, and vocational training and overall well-being. It will also focus on building resilient indigenous community by integrating its cultural identity, practices and needs into disaster risk reduction strategies of the government.</narrative>
  </description>
